---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Affiliate Disclosure | 48 Hours in California';
const pageDescription =
  'Affiliate Disclosure for 48 Hours in California.';
---

<Base title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <section>
    <p>48 Hours in California</p>

    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

    <p>
      48 Hours in California provides practical travel ideas, destination
      information, and 48-hour itineraries designed to help travelers make
      the most of short California getaways.
    </p>

    <h2>How Affiliate Links Work</h2>

    <p>
      Some links on this website may be affiliate links. This means that if
      you click one of these links and make a qualifying purchase or booking,
      48 Hours in California may receive a commission from the company
      providing the product or service.
    </p>

    <p>
      There is generally no additional cost to you for using an affiliate
      link. The commission is paid to us by the participating company or
      affiliate network.
    </p>

    <h2>Travel Recommendations</h2>

    <p>
      Affiliate relationships may include hotels, accommodations, tours,
      attractions, activities, transportation, travel services, retailers,
      and other businesses that may be useful when planning a California trip.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our goal is to recommend places, experiences, and services that we
      believe are relevant and useful to travelers. The possibility of
      receiving a commission does not guarantee that a business, destination,
      product, or service will be recommended.
    </p>

    <h2>Prices and Availability</h2>

    <p>
      Prices, availability, booking terms, cancellation policies, and other
      details are determined by third-party businesses and may change at any
      time. Please verify current information with the provider before making
      a purchase or reservation.
    </p>

    <h2>Supporting 48 Hours in California</h2>

    <p>
      When you use an affiliate link on 48 Hours in California, any commission
      we receive helps support the research, development, and maintenance of
      our California travel guides and itineraries.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>

    <p>
      If you have questions about our affiliate relationships or this
      disclosure, please contact us through our Contact page.
    </p>

    <p><em>Last updated: September 2026.</em></p>
  </section>
</Base>
